     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Boli mnie and bolą mnie",
     "texto": [
      "In Polish you say **boli mnie głowa** («my head hurts»). The body part is the subject; **mnie** is the object form of «I».",
      "If the body part is plural, the verb is also plural: **bolą mnie plecy**. Don't translate word for word from English."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
